{"script":"wt_c3_09_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]嗯，大批的魔物潮已经被打散了，魔物基本上都退回水里了。现在大家只需要去清理一些零星的漏网之鱼就好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]如果没有你们的帮助，契约者和水占师一定还会遭受更大的损失，是你们救了他们。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]等魔物退去之后，大家也可以休整一下，做好迎接下一次魔物潮的准备。这是一场漫长的战争啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]不过现在最重要的，是要对做出重大贡献的你们给予嘉奖。来，收下吧，这是你们应得的报酬。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara004_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":410,"trans":true,"y":-204,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1e","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"紧急契约：辛瓦特遗迹"}